# EntropyTag TODO Index

Status: IN_PROGRESS
Purpose: Living index for every planned work area.

## Status values

- NOT_STARTED - No implementation work has begun.
- IN_PROGRESS - Work is actively being executed.
- BLOCKED - Progress cannot continue; blocker and owner must be recorded.
- DONE - Every acceptance criterion is met and evidence is recorded.

## Completion rule

A task file may move to DONE only when:

- Every required checkbox is checked.
- Acceptance criteria are explicitly verified.
- Tests/builds/playtest evidence is recorded where applicable.
- Related documentation is updated.
- `.agent-context` is synchronized.
- The completion log records date, branch, commit or artifact, and validation.

## Work areas

- `01_PROJECT_FOUNDATION.todo` - Unity project, packages, assemblies, scenes, repository hygiene.
- `02_DOMAIN_RULES.todo` - Pure C# territory, reactions, score, bank, and match rules.
- `03_PLAYER_CAMERA_INPUT.todo` - Character motor, camera, aim, and devices.
- `04_TERRITORY_PAINTING.todo` - Logical field, visual mask, stamping, sampling, performance.
- `05_ELEMENT_REACTIONS.todo` - Ice, Fire, Mist, status, data, feedback.
- `06_MATCH_FLOW_SCORING.todo` - Match phases, pressure, HUD data, winner, rematch.
- `07_BOTS_AI.todo` - Seedable bot intent and first behavior profile.
- `08_UI_UX_ACCESSIBILITY.todo` - Front end, HUD, results, settings, accessibility.
- `09_ART_ANIMATION_VFX.todo` - Original visual identity and first-slice assets.
- `10_AUDIO.todo` - Spray, reaction, movement, UI, match, and music direction.
- `11_ARENA_LEVEL_DESIGN.todo` - Gray-box arena, paintability, pressure, navigation.
- `12_TESTING_PERFORMANCE_TOOLING.todo` - Tests, profiling, diagnostics, validators.
- `13_BUILD_RELEASE.todo` - Reproducible builds, versioning, artifact validation.
- `14_MULTIPLAYER_FUTURE.todo` - Deferred networking research and readiness checks.
- `15_PRODUCT_DECISIONS.todo` - Blocking product and technical decisions.
- `16_DOCUMENTATION_FOUNDATION.todo` - Completed planning package for this branch.
- `17_DEVELOPMENT_LEDGER.todo` - Living book-ready record of instructions, actions, evidence, and screenshots.

## Dependency summary

```text
15 Product decisions
  -> 01 Project foundation
      -> 02 Domain rules
      -> 03 Player/camera/input
          -> 04 Territory painting
              -> 05 Element reactions
              -> 06 Match flow/scoring
              -> 07 Bots
                  -> 08 UI/UX/accessibility
