14 Multiplayer remains deferred until the vertical slice is approved.
17 Development ledger remains active throughout every milestone.
```

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Every file inside `TODO/` ends in `.todo`.
- [x] Every scoped work file declares status, tasks, acceptance criteria, evidence, and completion log.
- [x] Dependencies and intentionally blocked work are visible.
- [ ] Keep this index synchronized whenever TODO files are added, renamed, completed, or removed.

